COMMENT     Route: CTLA-4 (AP-2, via surface)
COMMENT     Asks: Single-antigen (B) scaffold control.
COMMENT     Blunt-ligate into pJET1.2 in either orientation; recover the IVT
            template by PCR with IVT_F and IVT_R.
